---
# Benchmarks are full of sizes and percentiles that read best inline, and
# latency.cpp fragments the heap with raw malloc and free on purpose.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers,-readability-magic-numbers,-bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,-cppcoreguidelines-no-malloc,-cppcoreguidelines-owning-memory'
